  "description": "Doddle Conversion (CRO) OS — 30 skills and 5 agents for conversion rate optimization (landing pages, offers, A/B testing, UX, personalization, measurement). Deterministic Python toolkit computes A/B significance, sample sizes, landing audits and offer math; skills narrate. Hybrid format.",
  "author": { "name": "Doddle Team", "url": "https://doddlehq.com" },
  "homepage": "https://doddlehq.com",
